where it occurs.  Strings quoted by ‘’ are interpreted later (see
below), so ‘$’ substitution does not occur there until later,  if
at  all.   A ‘$’ is passed unchanged if followed by a blank, tab,
or end‐of‐line.  Input/output redirections are recognized  before
